# INVWINRD.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the bin labels
# printed on Windows' default printer, a label for every location in
# the order of the tree: its name bold, its code, its path and its type.
# Box B2 is first renamed with a letter of code page 437 beyond ASCII,
# which the label prints in the Windows character set.  The labels'
# Output is turned from SCREEN, the first offered, to PRINTER, and the
# box then says they are done; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINRD.SNP is its snapshot, and
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINRD.PRN what the test machine's printer, Generic /
# Text Only on a file, prints.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L B
K DOWN DOWN CTRL-E
T Caisse … vis
K ENTER
S SAVED
K ESC
K ALT-R B ALT-O DOWN
K ENTER
S PRINTED
K ENTER ESC
K ALT-F X
